  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; float: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span>(14 fotos) </span>Ha sido la noche de este lunes hacia las 21 horas. Un hombre de Vila-real, MFV, de 67 a&ntilde;os, que la habita espor&aacute;dicamente, seg&uacute;n ha dicho, no estaba dentro, pero ha pasado con su veh&iacute;culo al poco de llegar los bomberos y ha vuelto despu&eacute;s. </span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicasafustamontitales/img_4442.jpg\" alt=\"img_4442\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicasafustamontitales/img_4445.jpg\" alt=\"img_4445\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicasafustamontitales/img_4447.jpg\" alt=\"img_4447\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicasafustamontitales/img_4449.jpg\" alt=\"img_4449\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicasafustamontitales/img_4453.jpg\" alt=\"img_4453\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicasafustamontitales/img_4454.jpg\" alt=\"img_4454\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicasafustamontitales/img_4456.jpg\" alt=\"img_4456\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/i